sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Ticker worker
  participant M as Main thread
  participant S as localStorage
  W->>M: tick
  M->>M: elapsed = max(now − anchor, floor)
  M->>M: idle, midnight and tab-lock checks
  M->>M: redraw on the next frame
  M-->>S: saveState(), every 15th tick
  M->>W: ack
  Note over W,M: The next tick waits<br/>for this ack, so a busy<br/>page never piles up ticks
